  "details": "After seeing what happened last night, I feel like the game should notify everyone who's currently in-game or attempting to log in whenever a part of the website goes down unexpectedly. Similar to how server maintenance notifications appear on the first page of Quick Menu (i think), the same should happen here.\n\nAs for avatar/world uploads, There should be a warning in the VRCSDK's Authentication or Builder screen, depending on whatever goes down.",
